    "description": "",
    "product_description": "<div><br/></div><div><h3>Product Benefits</h3><div class=\"benefits-content\"><p>A modern Ayurvedic blend for instant calm, clarity, and skin renewal.</p><p>Product Benefits</p><p>Instant Cooling Relief:<br/>Menthol, cucumber, and peppermint extracts deliver a refreshing cooling sensation that calms irritation, redness, and heat-triggered sensitivity.</p><p>Balances &amp; Brightens Skin Tone:<br/>Niacinamide and Licorice Root extract visibly reduce dullness, dark spots, and uneven pigmentation for a clearer, radiant complexion.</p><p>Fights Acne &amp; Inflammation Naturally:<br/>Azelaic Acid, Neem, and Tulsi extracts work together to purify pores, fight bacterial growth, and soothe breakouts without dryness.</p><p>Deep Hydration Without Stickiness:<br/>Aloe Vera, Hyaluronic Acid, and D-Panthenol lock in moisture while keeping the skin light, smooth, and breathable.</p><p>Repairs &amp; Strengthens Skin Barrier:<br/>Gotu Kola and Manjistha promote cell renewal, boost collagen synthesis, and enhance natural healing.</p><p>Stress-Relief Aromatherapy:<br/>The soft herbal-mint aroma cools both skin and senses, leaving a refreshing, spa-like afterfeel.</p><p>Perfect for All Skin Types:<br/>Especially beneficial for oily, acne-prone, and sensitive skin; balances sebum while maintaining hydration.</p><p>100% Vegan | Ayurvedic | Free from Parabens, Silicones &amp; Sulphates</p><p>Ideal For:</p><p>Post-sun exposure or after workouts</p><p>Calming irritated, inflamed, or acne-prone skin</p><p>Restoring glow after stress or fatigue</p><p>Daily hydration during hot &amp; humid seasons</p></div><h3>How to Use &amp; Rituals</h3><div class=\"usage-content\"><p>Post-Sun Soothing Gel<br/>Instantly cools and calms skin after sun exposure.<br/>Reduces redness, heat rashes, and tanning discomfort.<br/>Perfect after beach days, outdoor events, or workouts.</p><p>Daily Hydration Gel<br/>Lightweight alternative to moisturizer for oily and acne-prone skin.<br/>Keeps skin hydrated without greasiness.<br/>Ideal under makeup or sunscreen for a smooth, matte finish.</p><p>After Shave or Wax Relief<br/>Calms irritation and minor inflammation post hair removal.<br/>Prevents bumps and ingrown hairs naturally.</p><p>Acne &amp; Redness Control Treatment<br/>Helps fade active breakouts and reduces redness.<br/>Fights post-acne marks with Niacinamide + Azelaic synergy.<br/>Soothes inflammation caused by stress or weather changes.</p><p>Post-Treatment Recovery Gel<br/>Perfect after chemical peels, facials, or dermat treatments.<br/>Supports healing and barrier repair while cooling the skin.</p><p>Cooling Night Gel<br/>Use as the last step in your night routine for hydration and glow.<br/>Repairs tired, inflamed skin overnight.</p><p>After-Workout or Travel Refresh<br/>Use to calm skin after sweating, gym sessions, or long travel.<br/>Keeps skin bacteria-free and refreshed on the go.</p><p>How to Use<br/>Apply a small amount to clean, dry skin.<br/>Gently massage until absorbed.<br/>Use AM &amp; PM or as needed for instant cooling.<br/>Can be layered under sunscreen or moisturizer.</p><p>Best Suited For:<br/>Oily, acne-prone, or combination skin<br/>Sensitive or heat-reactive skin<br/>Skin exposed to sun, pollution, or stress</p></div><h3>Ingredients</h3><p class=\"ingredients-list\"><em>Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Rosa Damascena Flower Water, Aqua (Water), Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Fruit Extract, Niacinamide, Azelaic Acid, Centella Asiatica Extract, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Azadirachta Indica (Neem) Leaf Extract, Ocimum Sanctum (Tulsi) Leaf Extract, Rubia Cordifolia (Manjistha) Root Extract, Emblica Officinalis (Amla) Fruit Extract, Glycerin, Sodium PCA, Propylene Glycol, Carbomer, Triethanolamine, Menthol, D-Panthenol (Pro-Vitamin B5), Sodium Hyaluronate, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil, Eucalyptus Globulus Leaf Oil, Disodium EDTA, Natural Fragrance (Herbal-Mint Blend)</em></p><div class=\"product-guarantee\"><p><strong>100% Vegan &amp; Cruelty Free</strong> | <strong>Formulated for Indian Skin</strong> | <strong>Safe &amp; Non-Toxic</strong></p></div></div>",
    "product_short_description": "<div class=\"advaya-product-details\">   <p class=\"lead-summary\">     <strong>Cooling Ayurvedic gel that calms, clears, and deeply       hydrates skin.</strong></p><div class=\"product-guarantee\">   </div> </div>",
